n others \u2013 like Goblins and Lizards \u2013 and some rare, like Balthazar, an ancient fearsome dragon. Defeat them and collect <strong>gold, loot, and XP points</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/2064216c4bc451ac4531cc08b7983481.poster.avif?t=1769770464\" width=482 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/2064216c4bc451ac4531cc08b7983481.webm?t=1769770464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/2064216c4bc451ac4531cc08b7983481.mp4?t=1769770464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liria is a shape-shifting land: every session plays on a <strong>different map</strong>, making every scenario unique and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/6c536037819f56bf93cf3c23ce2560c9.poster.avif?t=1769770464\" width=482 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/6c536037819f56bf93cf3c23ce2560c9.webm?t=1769770464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/extras/6c536037819f56bf93cf3c23ce2560c9.mp4?t=1769770464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Ramezware SL"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360090/header.jpg?t=1769770464","is_free":false,"linux